```suggestion
      timeoutRef.current = setTimeout(() => {
        lastRunRef.current = Date.now();
        timeoutRef.current = null;
        setThrottled(valueRef.current);
      }, intervalMs - elapsed);
```

Consider adding a test that issues ≥2 content updates inside one 80 ms window (with fake timers), advances past the window, and asserts the rendered output equals the *last* update.

